        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Loosely woven white silk tabby ground. Warp-figured pattern shows undulating blue stripe with one serrated edge and parts of two yellow coral branches. Tiny loops along selvedges. Soiled. Traces of glue in corners. Paper label marked 733 in one corner."@en ;
